{"sha": "799880b0f3fbff8ec9a6a320299c3e457e5cec7f8907ee1e470214a3d2392a0a", "body": ["\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "在简单拉伸中，将应力由 $0$ 增至 $\\sigma$ 的过程中，", "单位体积所做的功为 $\\int_0^\\varepsilon\\sigma'\\,\\dd\\varepsilon' =", "\\int_0^\\varepsilon E\\varepsilon'\\,\\dd\\varepsilon' = \\tfrac12", "E\\varepsilon^2$ --- 即应力--应变直线下的面积，与", "弹簧的情形完全一致。一般二次型可由各分量叠加得到，", "此结论在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % traction test sketch", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=0.4cm]", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (0,0) rectangle (3.2,1.0);", "    \\draw[omDef, thick] (-0.25,0.07) rectangle (3.45,0.93);", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (3.65,0.5) -- (4.55,0.5) node[right] {$F$};", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (-0.45,0.5) -- (-1.35,0.5) node[left] {$F$};", "    \\draw[<->] (0,-0.35) -- (3.2,-0.35);", "    \\node at (1.6,-0.7) {$L(1 + \\varepsilon)$};", "    \\node at (1.6,1.55) {截面 $S$，$\\sigma = F/S$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % stress-strain curve", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.3cm, yshift=-0.6cm]", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=6.4cm, height=4.6cm, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=0, ymax=1.25,", "    xlabel={$\\varepsilon$}, ylabel={$\\sigma$},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0:2] {0.4*x};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=2:8.7, samples=40]", "      {0.8 + 0.32*(1-exp(-(x-2)/2.2))};", "    \\fill (axis cs:2,0.8) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\draw (axis cs:2.05,0.83) -- (axis cs:2.55,1.1);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.55,1.14) {弹性极限};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omExo, anchor=west] at (axis cs:4.6,0.87) {塑性流动};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:8.55,1.2) {断裂};", "    \\fill[omThm] (axis cs:8.7,1.115) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, rotate=38, anchor=south] at (axis cs:1.15,0.48) {斜率 $E$};", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：拉伸试验定义了 $E$（相对伸长）和", "$\\nu$（横向变细，已夸大）。右：金属的应力--应变", "曲线 --- 弹性极限以内为线性弹性，此后", "为不可逆的塑性流动，最后断裂。本章主要", "讨论其中的直线部分。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[小形变弹性问题的求解]\\label{met:b3:continuum-elasticity:method}", "(1) 判断几何形状与受力情况，猜测哪些应力", "分量非零（受拉杆只有 $\\sigma_{xx}$；扭转", "金属丝为剪切；受压壳体为切向张力）。(2) 在恰当选取的部分上列写", "力平衡方程：取半圆柱、薄片或", "立方体。(3) 由胡克定律把应力化为应变，再通过积分由应变求位移。", "(4) 能量由 $w = \\sigma^2/2E$ 计算（剪切时", "用 $\\sigma^2/2G$）。(5) 始终检验应变保持为小量，且应力低于弹性极限", "--- 否则所得答案描述的将是", "一个已不复存在的固体。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{弹性波}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[固体中的两类波]\\label{prop:b3:continuum-elasticity:waves}", "\\index{弹性波}\\index{P 波}\\index{S 波}", "在密度为 $\\rho$ 的无界弹性固体中，微小扰动", "以两种相互独立的波的形式传播：", "\\emph{纵波}（P 波）中，物质沿传播方向", "通过压缩与膨胀振动，速率为", "\\[", "c_{\\text{P}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\lambda + 2\\mu}{\\rho}} ,", "\\]", "以及 \\emph{横波}（S 波），其中物质横向剪切，速率为", "\\[", "c_{\\text{S}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mu}{\\rho}} < c_{\\text{P}} .", "\\]", "流体有 $\\mu = 0$：不存在 S 波 --- 剪切无法传递 ---", "且 P 波速率退化为本科二年级分册中的声速。对于", "$\\nu = 1/4$（典型岩石），$\\lambda = \\mu$，且 $c_{\\text{P}} =", "\\sqrt3\\,c_{\\text{S}}$.", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "取平面扰动 $\\vect u = \\vect u(x, t)$。牛顿定律的单位体积形式为", "unit volume is $\\rho\\,\\partial_t^2u_i = \\sum_j\\partial_j\\sigma_{ij}$", "（即计入惯性的平衡方程）。对纵向分量，由胡克定律", "得 $\\sigma_{xx} = (\\lambda +", "2\\mu)\\,\\partial_xu_x$（平面波中横向应变为零，", "相邻物质阻止横向松弛），于是", "$\\rho\\,\\partial_t^2u_x = (\\lambda + 2\\mu)\\,\\partial_x^2u_x$：达朗贝尔方程，", "波速为 $c_{\\text{P}}$。对横向分量，$\\sigma_{yx} =", "2\\mu\\varepsilon_{yx} = \\mu\\,\\partial_xu_y$，于是", "$\\rho\\,\\partial_t^2u_y = \\mu\\,\\partial_x^2u_y$：速率为 $c_{\\text{S}}$。", "一般扰动可分解为这两族波，这一点在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % P wave: compressions along x", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\foreach \\x/\\s in {0/1.0, 0.42/0.72, 0.76/0.5, 1.04/0.5, 1.32/0.72,", "                       1.74/1.0, 2.26/1.28, 2.86/1.44, 3.46/1.28, 3.98/1.0,", "                       4.4/0.72, 4.74/0.5, 5.02/0.5, 5.3/0.72, 5.72/1.0,", "                       6.24/1.28, 6.84/1.44, 7.44/1.28, 7.96/1.0}", "      \\draw[omDef, thick] (\\x,0) -- (\\x,1.5);", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (8.4,0.75) -- (9.2,0.75) node[right] {$c_{\\text{P}}$};", "    \\draw[<->, omThm, thick] (0.6,-0.35) -- (1.5,-0.35);", "    \\node[anchor=west] at (3.6,-0.42) {物质运动 $\\parallel$ 传播方向};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % S wave: sheared line", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-3.3cm]", "    \\draw[omExo, thick, domain=0:8, samples=90, variable=\\t]", "      plot ({\\t}, {0.55*sin(deg(\\t*0.785))+0.75});", "    \\foreach \\x in {0.5,1.5,2.5,3.5,4.5,5.5,6.5,7.5}", "      \\draw[->, omExo!70] (\\x,{0.55*sin(deg(\\x*0.785))+0.75}) --", "        (\\x,{0.9*sin(deg(\\x*0.785+25))+0.75});", "    \\draw[->, very thick] (8.4,0.75) -- (9.2,0.75) node[right] {$c_{\\text{S}}$};", "    \\node at (2.9,-0.5) {物质运动 $\\perp$ 传播方向};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}